+     * VISIBILITY -- the output of Player_SetModels' own derivation -- not
+     * the logical held item. Keying on it means the shield leaves the arm
+     * the same frame the sword leaves the hand, including every visual-only
+     * stow where heldItemAction still claims the sword. */
